We may not be able to successfully implement our growth strategies on a timely basis or at all. Even if we are successful, if we fail to effectively manage our growth, our business and results of operations could be harmed.
We operate in a relatively new and rapidly changing category of preaccounting software, and widespread acceptance and use of our platform and features, particularly our expense management feature, is critical to our future growth and success.
